<title>UK: Boosey &amp; Hawkes H1 profits at record high.</title>
<headline>Boosey &amp; Hawkes H1 profits at record high.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		6.36		   vs 5.10</p>
